# GraphTimer

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphTimer } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphTimer
  title="example"
  kind={'elapsed'}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphTimer
  title="example"
  kind={'elapsed'}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `kind?` | `TimerKind` | `'elapsed'` | — |
| `at?` | `Date | number | string` | `—` | — |
| `caption?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `TimerKind`
- `GraphTimerProps`
